# Pure SaaS: /pure-saas verify

Verify finished implementation against requirements, design system, and quality standards.

## Usage
Type `@pure-saas-verify [request]` or `/pure-saas verify [request]` in Composer or Chat.

## Instructions
1. Run token enforcement: `node scripts/pure-saas.mjs check-tokens DESIGN.md --source src`.
2. Validate design system schema: `node scripts/pure-saas.mjs validate DESIGN.md`.
3. Run project build and test suites (`npm test`, `npm run build`, typechecking).
4. Inspect desktop (1440px), tablet (768px), and mobile (375px) viewports for layout fidelity.
5. Report verified checks, fixed issues, and untested areas honestly. Never fabricate verification results.
